{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q411537","formula":"C₂₀H₃₀N₂O₂","hill":"C20H30N2O2","elements":["H","C","N","O"],"composition":{"C":20.0,"H":30.0,"N":2.0,"O":2.0},"names":{"en":"Furazabol"},"descriptions":{"en":"Furazabol (INNTooltip International Nonproprietary Name, JANTooltip Japanese Accepted Name; brand names Frazalon, Miotalon, Qu Zhi Shu; also known as androfurazanol) is a synthetic, orally active anabolic-androgenic steroid which has been marketed in Japan since 1969. It is a 17α-alkylated derivative of dihydrotestosterone (DHT) and is closely related structurally to stanozolol, differing from it only by having a furazan ring system instead of pyrazole. Furazabol has a relatively high ratio of anabolic to androgenic activity.","uk":"Фуразабол (англ. Furazabol), тргові марки «Фразалон», «Міоталон», «Цюй Чжи Шу»; також відомий як Андрофуразанол — синтетичний перорально активний андрогенний анаболічний стероїд, який продається в Японії з 1969 року. Це 17α-алкільоване похідне дигідротестостерону (ДГТ), структурно тісно пов'язана зі станозололом, відрізняючись від нього лише наявністю фуразанової кільцевої системи замість піразолу."},"fame":11,"pubchemCid":14708,"mass":330.5,"charge":0,"smiles":"C[C@]12CC[C@H]3[C@H]([C@@H]1CC[C@]2(C)O)CC[C@@H]4[C@@]3(CC5=NON=C5C4)C","inchikey":"RGLLOUBXMOGLDQ-IVEVATEUSA-N","iupac":"(1S,2S,10S,13R,14S,17S,18S)-2,17,18-trimethyl-6-oxa-5,7-diazapentacyclo[11.7.0.02,10.04,8.014,18]icosa-4,7-dien-17-ol","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"14708","atoms":54,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-5.437,"y":1.245,"z":-0.376,"el":"O"},{"x":5.879,"y":1.022,"z":0.332,"el":"O"},{"x":4.72,"y":1.811,"z":0.372,"el":"N"},{"x":5.573,"y":-0.337,"z":0.174,"el":"N"},{"x":-2.402,"y":-0.7,"z":0.314,"el":"C"},{"x":-3.049,"y":0.578,"z":-0.263,"el":"